# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This project's own control plane — local runtime state, never tracked.
#
# `wiki/.codx` holds the task bodies, chat turns, harness journal,
# orchestration and board state of THIS project. It is not tracked today
# (`git ls-files wiki/.codx` returns nothing), but it is also not ignored:
# `git check-ignore -v wiki/.codx` exits 1. Consequence: every agent shift
# leaves hundreds of untracked files in the working tree, and every
# repo-wide diff / security review has to walk them.
#
# The repo-root .gitignore only covers the ROOT `.codx` data plane. Its
# patterns (`.codx/autonomy/`, `.codx/harness/`, `.codx/logs/`, ...) contain a
# slash and are therefore anchored to the root directory, so they do not match
# a nested `wiki/.codx/...`. Nested project control planes need their own rule.
#
# Tracked vs generated inside `.codx` is a deliberate split owned by the
# platform (`api/codx/junior/runtime.py: DATA_PLANE_ENTRIES`, mirrored by
# `api/tests/security/ciso_repo_check.py`); this file only removes the
# untracked noise of this project.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.codx/
